     help
         The application will access this URL to check for new firmwares and server address.
 
+menu "Role Household (rh)"
+
+config RH_SILENT_LOCAL_SOUNDS
+    bool "Never play built-in local sounds (boot/wifi-config/activation/alerts)"
+    default y
+    help
+        rh: the board must not speak on its own. All built-in OGG prompts
+        (success, wifi config, activation code digits, popup, alerts, low battery)
+        are dropped in AudioService::PlaySound. Audio pushed by the host (TTS
+        Opus stream, notify audio_url) is not affected.
+        Source: code review item 4; user: no sound while asleep/away.
+
+config RH_DISABLE_MIC_UPLINK
+    bool "Disable on-board listening (no microphone upload)"
+    # rh-uplink: default n -- the host now decodes the board's microphone (role-household rh/board_mic.py)
+    # and runs it through the same wake word / pause / mute / ASR chain as the Mac mic.
+    # Source: maintainer 2026-10-19 "必做「板子收音」…固件放开上行的改动编好但不刷".
+    default n
+    help
+        rh: step one is output-only (speak + facial expression). Any transition
+        to the Listening state is redirected to Idle, so the device never sends
+        listen/start or microphone audio. The audio channel itself may stay open
+        so the host can push tts/llm-emotion.
+        Source: code review item 1.
+
+config RH_HOST_PUSH
+    bool "Keep the audio channel open so the host can push speech any time"
+    default y
+    help
+        rh: (1) open the audio channel right after activation/OTA, (2) reopen it
+        RH_REOPEN_DELAY_SEC after it closes, fails, or times out, (3) on tts stop
+        drop whatever is still in the decode/playback queues so a host-side pause
+        is silent at once. Idle + tts start -> Speaking is upstream behaviour.
+        Source: host side the bothouse-iot device service c3bba51 rh/xiaozhi.py, requested
+        by the maintainer 2026-10-19.
+
+config RH_REOPEN_DELAY_SEC
+    int "Seconds to wait before reopening the audio channel"
+    default 5
+    range 1 600
+    depends on RH_HOST_PUSH
+    help
+        Source: maintainer 2026-10-19 "隔几秒再 OpenAudioChannel()"; 5 is my pick of "a few".
+
+config RH_DIAL
+    bool "Show the role dial (same look as the hub web dial page) instead of the xiaozhi UI"
+    default y
+    depends on BOARD_TYPE_SPOTPEAR_ESP32_S3_1_28_BOX
+    help
+        rh: draw the round dial of the bothouse-iot device service rh/static/dial.html with LVGL
+        (avatar, name pill, idle breathe + glint, thinking spinner, speaking glow + bars,
+        interrupted red ring) on top of the default emoji / subtitle / status bar UI,
+        which stays hidden except in Wi-Fi config mode. Which role, name, colour, avatar
+        and state come from the host ({"type":"rh_dial"} over the WebSocket); nothing
+        role-specific is compiled in. Only wired into spotpear sp-esp32-s3-1.28-box,
+        so only that board can turn it on (other boards then neither fetch conest's cn_dial
+        nor wait for the host's rh_dial before marking a new OTA image valid).
+        Source: user 2026-10-19 (replace the default xiaozhi face with our own role dial);
+        code review (role pushed by host, not fixed in firmware).
+
+config RH_DIAL_DEPS
+    int
+    # Hidden 0/1 mirror of RH_DIAL for main/idf_component.yml's cn_dial rules only. A bool that is
+    # off because its "depends on" fails is left out of sdkconfig.json, and the component manager
+    # then stops with "RH_DIAL ... not found in any Kconfig file" on every other board
+    # (waveshare esp32-s3-touch-amoled-1.75, 2026-10-20). An int with a plain default is always
+    # written, so the rule can be evaluated on every board/target. 1 = fetch cn_dial, 0 = do not.
+    default 1 if RH_DIAL
+    default 0
+
+config RH_ALWAYS_LISTEN
+    bool "Listen whenever idle once the host audio channel is open"
+    depends on RH_HOST_PUSH && !RH_DISABLE_MIC_UPLINK
+    default y
+    help
+        rh: there is no on-board wake word; the host spots the wake words (rh/kws.py) and
+        decides who answers, so the board must stream its microphone without a button press.
+        After the audio channel opens and the board is idle, enter Listening with the default
+        mode (auto stop when AEC is off: no upload while speaking, back to Listening after tts stop).
+        The host drops all board audio while muted (闭麦). Source: same as RH_DISABLE_MIC_UPLINK.
+
+endmenu
